---
// Hero section
---
<section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center overflow-hidden pt-20">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-terra-100 via-terra-50 to-verde-50"></div>
    <svg class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 opacity-10" viewBox="0 0 1440 320" preserveAspectRatio="none">
      <path fill="#578f3e" fill-opacity="1"
        d="M0,224L80,213.3C160,203,320,181,480,186.7C640,192,800,224,960,218.7C1120,213,1280,171,1360,149.3L1440,128L1440,320L1360,320C1280,320,1120,320,960,320C800,320,640,320,480,320C320,320,160,320,80,320L0,320Z">
      </path>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
    <div>
      <span class="inline-block bg-verde-100 text-verde-700 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6">
        Crowdfunding Inmobiliario
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-verde-900 leading-tight mb-6">
        Invierte en bienes raíces <span class="text-terra-600">desde $500 USD</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-tierra-700 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-lg">
        TerraFertil democratiza el acceso al mercado inmobiliario. Diversifica tu patrimonio invirtiendo en proyectos cuidadosamente seleccionados, con total transparencia y sin complicaciones.
      </p>
      <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-md">
        <input
          type="email"
          placeholder="tu@correo.com"
          required
          class="flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-full border border-tierra-300 bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-verde-400 text-gray-700 placeholder-tierra-400"
        />
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="bg-verde-600 hover:bg-verde-700 active:bg-verde-800 text-white font-semibold px-7 py-3 rounded-full transition-colors whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Únete a la lista
        </button>
      </form>
      <p class="text-tierra-500 text-sm mt-3">Sin tarjeta de crédito. Sin compromiso.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hidden lg:flex justify-center">
      <div class="relative w-80">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-6 border border-tierra-100">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-verde-700 bg-verde-100 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">Disponible</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-tierra-500">Monterrey, MX</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full h-36 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-tierra-200 to-verde-200 mb-4 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
            <svg class="w-16 h-16 text-verde-400 opacity-60" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1"
                d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-verde-900 mb-1">Torre Verde Residencial</h3>
          <p class="text-tierra-600 text-sm mb-4">Departamentos premium en zona de alto crecimiento</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-center">
            <div class="bg-terra-50 rounded-lg p-2">
              <p class="text-xs text-tierra-500">Rendimiento</p>
              <p class="font-bold text-verde-700 text-lg">12.5%</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-terra-50 rounded-lg p-2">
              <p class="text-xs text-tierra-500">Desde</p>
              <p class="font-bold text-terra-600 text-lg">$500</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-tierra-500 mb-1">
              <span>68% fondeado</span>
              <span>$340,000 / $500,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-tierra-100 rounded-full h-2">
              <div class="bg-verde-500 h-2 rounded-full" style="width:68%"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 bg-terra-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-lg">
          +230 inversores
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 bg-white border border-tierra-200 text-tierra-700 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-md">
          ✅ Proyecto verificado
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
